  of Photopea!\nWe will be using the free versions of both web-based platfo
 rms\, Canva being a graphic design editor and Photopea being a photo edito
 r.  Your maps will have limited camera movement\, colour changes plus a d
 otted trail\, while one of your graphs will have slight movement of its ba
 rs.\nPlease come prepared with your own Canva account.\nYou can sign up at
 \ncanva.com\neither by using your e-mail address or logging in with your A
 pple ID\, Facebook account\, Gmail\, Outlook\, etc.\nRegistration is requi
 red for this class and begins August 10\, 2026 at 12:30pm.\nNote: Your spo
 t will not be guaranteed after 5 minutes of the start of the program.\nInf
 ormation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is coll
 ected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, secti
 ons 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event
