BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The A(i)\, B\, C’s of Artificial Intelligence
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260813T173000
UID:6a247be3caf9343600611e49@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This week-long workshop series introduces teens to the four "
 must knows" of Artificial Intelligence. Through video clips\, props\, an o
 riginal AI literacy song\, discussions\, and hands-on activities\, partici
 pants will explore how AI works\, how it’s used\, and how to think criti
 cally about its impact. By the end of the program\, attendees will be bett
 er equipped to navigate AI and social media with awareness and creativity.
  The workshop is led by Keith McDonald\, founder and Chief Curator of Toro
 nto’s\nThe literacy AI project\n.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Youth Hub
