BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Womp 3D: 3D Modeling
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260822T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260822T113000
UID:6a5e6da01bbbb30f3e80a313@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Create stunning 3D designs with professional tools in your bro
 wser. From concept to render in minutes.\nWomp 3D is a free\, browser-base
 d tool that allows users to create and export 3D models quick and easy. It
  offers a user-friendly interface for building models from basic shapes\, 
 with features like real-time rendering\, boolean operations\, and the abil
 ity to export models in various formats for 3D printing and more.\nThe pla
 tform provides a straightforward way to create models by combining and man
 ipulating primitives like cubes\, spheres\, and cylinders.\nWomp enables u
 sers to subtract or add shapes using boolean operations\, allowing for the
  creation of complex forms.\nThe tool renders models in real-time\, provid
 ing immediate visual feedback as users work.\nInformation Collection Notic
 e:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Publ
 ic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 2
 0(d). The information will only be used for event and program registration
 \, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your i
 nformation can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 4
 16-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Agincourt\, Learning Centre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a5e6da01bbbb30f3e80a313
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
