 es to get her family to accept him while she comes to terms with her herit
 age and cultural identity. Celebrate the return of the\nTaste of the Danfo
 rth\nwith a movie that was filmed in the heart of Toronto!\nLight refreshm
 ents will be served or feel free to bring your own! Film will be shown wit
 h closed captions. Rated PG.\nDrop-ins welcome or register to receive a re
 minder email.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on
