UID:6a1b24bcf6bd012f006b66d8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come join us every Saturday for screenings of your favourite movies. In ad
 dition to this\, enjoy cuddles with a therapy dog! Therapy dog Goose visi
 ts Fort York Branch on alternate Saturdays from 11:00AM-12:00PM.\nWe'll b
 e showing the following films:\nJuly 4 - Harold & The Purple Crayon\nJuly 
 11 - Moana 2\nJuly 18 - Angry Birds(2016)\nJuly 25 - The Computer Wore Ten
 nis Shoes\nAug 1 - King Fu Panda 4\nAug 8 - Agent Cody Banks 2\nAug 15 -
  Matilda\nAug 22 - Beauty& The Beast(1991)\nAug 29 - Jumanji\nSept 5 -
  101 Dalmatians(1961)\nSept 12 - Beverly Hills Chihuahua\nSept 19 - A B
 ug's Life\nSept 26 - The Boss Baby\nDrop-ins are welcome.\nThis program i
 s in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Urban Living Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a1b24bcf6bd012f006b66d8
